    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever or unplanned weight loss</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Epigastric burning; no vomiting, black stools or blood</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain on exertion, shortness of breath or palpitations</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Left hindfoot pain much improved since the injection</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

